Natural-language food product search over Open Food Facts.

- Design: docs/open-food-facts-product-representation.md (OFF data formats, the product
  representation, and the query pipeline)
- Reference code: off_products/ (normalize OFF JSONL/Parquet, ingredient groups, QuerySpec -> SQL/Pinecone)
- Deploy and test, step by step: docs/DEPLOY.md
- Tests: python -m pytest tests
